{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/8010f20964dde59ccb20579a23898ce0.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/8010f20964dde59ccb20579a23898ce0.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/8010f20964dde59ccb20579a23898ce0.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Merge and Blade is a fantasy puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will engage in large-scale battles with monsters with your own squad which is made using merge mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a battle, you can recruit new units using merge mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By proceeding with these puzzles and battles, you will retake the castles occupied by monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/6232e48793a6780999c90be20736592f.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/6232e48793a6780999c90be20736592f.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/6232e48793a6780999c90be20736592f.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you retake the castle one by one, your base and squad get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will continue until retaking the last castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, even if you retake the last castle, your journey won't completely end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are endless invading monsters that you have to hold off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can battle with your friends or can save the world again with another strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to save this world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/dc948696f7bc48029c4686c0543c90db.webp?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/44b54a9d99296748816b13d7f38e364d.webp?t=1743600157\" width=450 height=22 /></span>This game is a puzzle that builds blocks that come down like Tetris, Hexa, and Puyo Puyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's not about holding out for a long time or removing blocks. it's about merging the same three or more units to create a higher class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/e119e773d4bc0f9901d0c574dd168275.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/e119e773d4bc0f9901d0c574dd168275.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/e119e773d4bc0f9901d0c574dd168275.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The goal of the puzzle is to create a squad as strong as possible within a limited turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can make a much stronger squad or can get additional turns with multi-merge, combo, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/31d9129b1bf2839c52bb1739f567f35e.webp?t=1743600157\" width=450 height=22 /></span>Battles are performed in real-time up to 25 v 25.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/8c48ff2957210c7e6072e2a1dc0a6183.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/8c48ff2957210c7e6072e2a1dc0a6183.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/8c48ff2957210c7e6072e2a1dc0a6183.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In battles, formation is important, as well as each unit's stats. This is because each unit has its own attack types and attack or heal ranges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So it's good to care about the position of the unit when you place units in the puzzle part. In addition, you can use swaps to change their position in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/b8902f60cd51f95797424627ba87d444.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/b8902f60cd51f95797424627ba87d444.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/b8902f60cd51f95797424627ba87d444.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/1010074a9506c87b8329bf45c331b8b1.webp?t=1743600157\" width=450 height=22 /></span>You can use gold from puzzles and battles to upgrade your base and units in your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base upgrades provide unlocking the merging list and adding the number of turns, previews, and swap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units upgrades increase the unit's HP and ATK, giving you an advantage in battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/be3564f319f7af2ea25874bfe139ee75.avif?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/93b3dae0a2d2dafab8a387d4d2742a99.webp?t=1743600157\" width=450 height=22 /></span>Survive from the endless monsters as long as you can with your squad you've grown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/76b30c07341943da1e4795ccb5ba06d6.webp?t=1743600157\" width=450 height=22 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/b5c15134580b58ed1a3a0e169fbc28a2.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/b5c15134580b58ed1a3a0e169fbc28a2.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/b5c15134580b58ed1a3a0e169fbc28a2.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Brag your puzzle skill in this local multi-player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even play with your friends who don't have the game using Steam remote play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/875853e19e42ed980703af111bb4378c.webp?t=1743600157\" width=450 height=22 /></span>It's another land only for the challenge mode. Make a new squad, and complete from start to finish at one go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/1b1d84689dfa7c435f0e9b15ee3b2948.webp?t=1743600157\" width=450 height=22 /></span>You can compete with other players with the defense mode score, etc.<br><br><strong>Updated Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Roguelike Mode</strong>: Use various characters to explore and grow, experiencing something new every time</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golem Factory: Defeat golems hatched by fanatics in this challenging mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night of Reckoning: Launch a surprise attack on a lich\u2019s castle in a 15-round puzzle-based showdown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mithril Mines: Mine mithril ore to gather vast resources in this resource-focused mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Into the Darkness: Explore an endless underground dungeon with no known end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Roguelite Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 100-stage roguelite mode with 10\u201330 rounds per stage. Use crystals earned in-game to upgrade characters, units, and facilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Suppression Mode</strong>: Real-Time Battle Mode</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebellion Suppression Mode: A 10-stage arcade-style real-time puzzle battle campaign to crush rebellions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punishment Mode: A survivor mode aiming to break stage records, challenging you to punish endless waves of traitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/228192db97809a2d20ac859ba061b1f8.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=504 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/228192db97809a2d20ac859ba061b1f8.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/228192db97809a2d20ac859ba061b1f8.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/939fbb3b6e4b0fc99d1fa9b58ba7a2f2.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=504 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/939fbb3b6e4b0fc99d1fa9b58ba7a2f2.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/939fbb3b6e4b0fc99d1fa9b58ba7a2f2.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/237cd917d454b201a71dc25cd8bc1882.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=504 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/237cd917d454b201a71dc25cd8bc1882.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/237cd917d454b201a71dc25cd8bc1882.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/2e28c60ba8192be80b6b84f196666f57.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=504 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/2e28c60ba8192be80b6b84f196666f57.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/2e28c60ba8192be80b6b84f196666f57.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/d9f5e461fecea26df68ac9175973098e.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=504 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/d9f5e461fecea26df68ac9175973098e.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/d9f5e461fecea26df68ac9175973098e.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/48234475b873f3e5b352cb814c4cd223.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=504 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/48234475b873f3e5b352cb814c4cd223.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/48234475b873f3e5b352cb814c4cd223.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/41d3a116902f11f076789e72cee25d9a.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=504 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/41d3a116902f11f076789e72cee25d9a.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/41d3a116902f11f076789e72cee25d9a.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/109b654c6f7e5de784c6d3da1ca2c0f6.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=504 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/109b654c6f7e5de784c6d3da1ca2c0f6.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/109b654c6f7e5de784c6d3da1ca2c0f6.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/73c1394af7c6ccf1211243d09693da1b.apng?t=1743600157\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/73c1394af7c6ccf1211243d09693da1b.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" class=\"bb_img\" width=504 height=284 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/815d2516a64115c1ed81eeb8d738f7d3.apng?t=1743600157\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/815d2516a64115c1ed81eeb8d738f7d3.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" class=\"bb_img\" width=504 height=284 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/eabdeb014ddd2e5a6824bca98c25a3f7.apng?t=1743600157\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/eabdeb014ddd2e5a6824bca98c25a3f7.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" class=\"bb_img\" width=504 height=284 /></picture></span></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Saver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/b604204347a3cb4a7dc0db4578faf3aa99998049.jpg"},{"name":"Challenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/183b238a49c485d2f8c10d08bcebf61ecb2e4b36.jpg"},{"name":"Keeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/f08f29932a5b550ea5b10cd801b0408352881917.jpg"},{"name":"Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/e968a32171282fddfd111d866c37295664547e12.jpg"},{"name":"Merge Mania","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/679467cc2e925bb7d6091e63e91cbeb5fa68af31.jpg"},{"name":"Merge Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/3466e5c186967423c39e3dfbd1007521a813232f.jpg"},{"name":"Combo Mania","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/56ba0fdaecac0fdaeddee92d79e27ad5801965ed.jpg"},{"name":"Combo Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/710f34a7d3c2705e98a1861c89b41525768fbfac.jpg"},{"name":"Goblin Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/142487a8b262a0c3fc443133852f7386f45d5f4c.jpg"},{"name":"Ork Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1446930/ff1af57e987927301ec056b172d1635f6bc96432.jpg"}],"total":78},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1446930?t=1743600157","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743600157","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743600157","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743600157","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1488880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/8010f20964dde59ccb20579a23898ce0.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/8010f20964dde59ccb20579a23898ce0.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/8010f20964dde59ccb20579a23898ce0.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Merge and Blade is a fantasy puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will engage in large-scale battles with monsters with your own squad which is made using merge mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a battle, you can recruit new units using merge mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By proceeding with these puzzles and battles, you will retake the castles occupied by monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/6232e48793a6780999c90be20736592f.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/6232e48793a6780999c90be20736592f.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/6232e48793a6780999c90be20736592f.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you retake the castle one by one, your base and squad get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey will continue until retaking the last castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, even if you retake the last castle, your journey won't completely end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are endless invading monsters that you have to hold off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can battle with your friends or can save the world again with another strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to save this world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/dc948696f7bc48029c4686c0543c90db.webp?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/44b54a9d99296748816b13d7f38e364d.webp?t=1743600157\" width=450 height=22 /></span>This game is a puzzle that builds blocks that come down like Tetris, Hexa, and Puyo Puyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's not about holding out for a long time or removing blocks. it's about merging the same three or more units to create a higher class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/e119e773d4bc0f9901d0c574dd168275.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/e119e773d4bc0f9901d0c574dd168275.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/e119e773d4bc0f9901d0c574dd168275.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The goal of the puzzle is to create a squad as strong as possible within a limited turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can make a much stronger squad or can get additional turns with multi-merge, combo, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/31d9129b1bf2839c52bb1739f567f35e.webp?t=1743600157\" width=450 height=22 /></span>Battles are performed in real-time up to 25 v 25.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/8c48ff2957210c7e6072e2a1dc0a6183.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/8c48ff2957210c7e6072e2a1dc0a6183.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/8c48ff2957210c7e6072e2a1dc0a6183.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In battles, formation is important, as well as each unit's stats. This is because each unit has its own attack types and attack or heal ranges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So it's good to care about the position of the unit when you place units in the puzzle part. In addition, you can use swaps to change their position in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/b8902f60cd51f95797424627ba87d444.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/b8902f60cd51f95797424627ba87d444.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/b8902f60cd51f95797424627ba87d444.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/1010074a9506c87b8329bf45c331b8b1.webp?t=1743600157\" width=450 height=22 /></span>You can use gold from puzzles and battles to upgrade your base and units in your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base upgrades provide unlocking the merging list and adding the number of turns, previews, and swap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units upgrades increase the unit's HP and ATK, giving you an advantage in battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/be3564f319f7af2ea25874bfe139ee75.avif?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/93b3dae0a2d2dafab8a387d4d2742a99.webp?t=1743600157\" width=450 height=22 /></span>Survive from the endless monsters as long as you can with your squad you've grown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/76b30c07341943da1e4795ccb5ba06d6.webp?t=1743600157\" width=450 height=22 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/b5c15134580b58ed1a3a0e169fbc28a2.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/b5c15134580b58ed1a3a0e169fbc28a2.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/b5c15134580b58ed1a3a0e169fbc28a2.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Brag your puzzle skill in this local multi-player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even play with your friends who don't have the game using Steam remote play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/875853e19e42ed980703af111bb4378c.webp?t=1743600157\" width=450 height=22 /></span>It's another land only for the challenge mode. Make a new squad, and complete from start to finish at one go. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/1b1d84689dfa7c435f0e9b15ee3b2948.webp?t=1743600157\" width=450 height=22 /></span>You can compete with other players with the defense mode score, etc.<br><br><strong>Updated Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Roguelike Mode</strong>: Use various characters to explore and grow, experiencing something new every time</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golem Factory: Defeat golems hatched by fanatics in this challenging mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night of Reckoning: Launch a surprise attack on a lich\u2019s castle in a 15-round puzzle-based showdown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mithril Mines: Mine mithril ore to gather vast resources in this resource-focused mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Into the Darkness: Explore an endless underground dungeon with no known end.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Roguelite Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 100-stage roguelite mode with 10\u201330 rounds per stage. Use crystals earned in-game to upgrade characters, units, and facilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 <strong>Suppression Mode</strong>: Real-Time Battle Mode</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebellion Suppression Mode: A 10-stage arcade-style real-time puzzle battle campaign to crush rebellions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punishment Mode: A survivor mode aiming to break stage records, challenging you to punish endless waves of traitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/228192db97809a2d20ac859ba061b1f8.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=504 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/228192db97809a2d20ac859ba061b1f8.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/228192db97809a2d20ac859ba061b1f8.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/939fbb3b6e4b0fc99d1fa9b58ba7a2f2.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=504 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/939fbb3b6e4b0fc99d1fa9b58ba7a2f2.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/939fbb3b6e4b0fc99d1fa9b58ba7a2f2.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/237cd917d454b201a71dc25cd8bc1882.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=504 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/237cd917d454b201a71dc25cd8bc1882.webm?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/237cd917d454b201a71dc25cd8bc1882.mp4?t=1743600157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/2e28c60ba8192be80b6b84f196666f57.poster.avif?t=1743600157\" width=504 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446930/extras/2e28c